Hi all!

I'm now uploading about 3.1 GB of alpha pkgs (~ 3000 pkgs) to
ftp://ftp.rdsor.ro/core/development/alpha.

This will - of course - take a while. If you feel funny you can try a
repoclosure, but it will spot a lot of missing deps... However. I upload
them to make 'em available to others and have some kind of offshore
backup :-)

I'm note sure how long it will take, because uploads go with 500 kb/s -
1 mb/s... It should be done as soon as
"zzuf-debuginfo-0.9-1.fc8.alpha.rpm" has been uploaded. :-)

Best,
 Oliver



